{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liuliao-e-o052","title":"亮病困作退军节度延欲率军击贼","accounts":[{"id":"liuliao-a-1c7dff439075d445c350","label":"正文","text":"亮病困作退军节度延欲率军击贼","evidence":["liuliao-q-77af79b2872276af9e44"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"病困作身殁后退军节度","evidence":["liuliao-q-77af79b2872276af9e44"]},{"person":"zhuge-p0045","role":"与作退军节度、令费祎探意","evidence":["liuliao-q-77af79b2872276af9e44"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0051","role":"与作节度、探延意、与延作行留部分","evidence":["liuliao-q-77af79b2872276af9e44"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0050","role":"与作节度、被令次魏延断后","evidence":["liuliao-q-77af79b2872276af9e44"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0091","role":"被令断后；声称继续击贼并与祎作行留部分","evidence":["liuliao-q-77af79b2872276af9e44"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-77af79b2872276af9e44"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuliao-q-77af79b2872276af9e44","source_order":[40,291,0],"order":7309}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0050","name":"姜维","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0051","name":"费祎","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0091","name":"魏延","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-p0045","name":"杨仪","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liuliao-q-77af79b2872276af9e44","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-46fe7f140656f2fef98a","layer":"original","quote":"秋，亮病困，密与长史杨仪、司马费祎、护军姜维等，作身殁之后退军节度〖1〗：令延断后，姜维次之；若延或不从命，军便自发。亮适卒，秘不发丧；仪令祎往揣延意指〖2〗。延曰：“丞相虽亡，吾自见在。府亲官属，便可将丧还葬；吾自当率诸军击贼。云何以一人死，废天下之事邪？且魏延何人？当为杨仪所部勒〖3〗，作断后将乎！”因与祎共作行留部分；令祎手书与己连名，告下诸将。","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":290,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":177,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
